OL,3,GNEWSA'It's a new way of living', says
OL,4,AOlivia's mum four years on
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Life will never be the same," says the
OL,7,Fmother of Olivia Pratt-Korbel, four
OL,8,Fyears after her daughter was murdered
OL,9,Fin their family home.
OL,11,F"It's just a new way, trying a new way
OL,12,Fof living."
OL,14,FCheryl Korbel was wounded by the same
OL,15,Fbullet that killed Olivia when it was
OL,16,Ffired through the front door of their
OL,17,Fhome in Liverpool by drug dealer Thomas
OL,18,FCashman.
